# Skill invoke

Copyright (c) 2026 Devrecated.

Read `.cursor/skills/autodevelop/skill-invoke.yaml` before starting a Devrecated skill.

- `manual` — only if the user named the skill or `/slash` **in this chat**. Do not start it from a hook, leftover session, or ambient guess.
- `automatic` — may start when the task matches.
- Missing name — follow that skill’s `disable-model-invocation` frontmatter (`true` = manual).

`checkout-worktree` and `rogue-worktree-cleanup` are **manual**. Do not scan or switch worktrees unless they asked.

When you start a Devrecated skill, record it (gitignored log):

```bash
node .cursor/skills/autodevelop/skill-invoke.mjs record <name> <manual|automatic>
```
